 ...a-context-master-per-device-and-IOMM.patch | 50 +++++++++++++++
 ...MMU-device-for-page-table-allocation.patch | 61 +++++++++++++++++++
 ...ARM-DMA-mapping-before-attaching-own.patch | 49 +++++++++++++++
 .../linux/linux-linaro-qcomlt_%.bbappend      |  4 ++
 5 files changed, 190 insertions(+)
